{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“Serre 函子”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Serre函子"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Serre 函子实现了 "},{"Local":{"url":"Serre对偶","text":"Serre 对偶"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $\\mathsf A$ 为 $k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"线性范畴","text":"线性范畴"}},{"Plain":". Serre 函子是 $k$-线性等价 $\\mathsf A\\to \\mathsf A$, 具有自然同构\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(A,B)\\to \\operatorname{Hom}(B,S(A))^*.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>设 $X$ 是 $k$ 上的光滑射影代数簇, 那么\n$$\r\nS_X \\colon D^b(X)\\to D^b(X)\r\n$$\n为 Serre 函子.</p>\n"}]}}